- The oracle samples live entropy to produce collapse seeds for quantum subsystems.
- `[REDACTED]` masks the exact thresholds, spike responses, and pooling heuristics used to validate seeds in production.

## Sanitized Operations
- The oracle records seed metadata for later promotion and exposes helper queries to downstream systems.
